    <string name="whats_new_title">What\'s new in v%1$s</string>
    <string-array name="whats_new_items">
        <item>Recommended settings (Ⓨ in a game\'s options): settings suggested for that game on this device, each with its reason. Undo at any time, and they are undone on their own if the game fails to start.</item>
        <item>Image quality in Graphics: FSR 1, Snapdragon GSR and bicubic upscaling, RCAS sharpening and SMAA anti-aliasing.</item>
        <item>Post-processing: 19 effects you can chain and tune (bloom, CRT, scanlines, film grain, color grade, cel shading…) and six presets, globally or per game.</item>
        <item>Works with Bramble: play time, trophies, game settings and save backups that you approve. A new tab gathers every game\'s trophies.</item>
        <item>Unreal Engine games that crashed about a minute into play no longer do: x86 memory ordering is now emulated.</item>
        <item>Adreno 6xx and 7xx phones on older system drivers are no longer refused at start.</item>
        <item>A large NGS2 and AudioOut2 audio update, a big shader recompiler update and about 200 fixes from KytyPS5.</item>
    </string-array>
